    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1114_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "So in the end, she managed to make it this far.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fremont"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1114_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now what should I praise Her Highness for? Her stubbornness, or her incredible talents? Pah, forget it. No matter if I scold her or praise her, the myriad souls wouldn't be able to hear it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fremont"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let us put the situation in Victoria aside for the moment. Theresis and Nezzsalem will sort out that mess.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fremont"
    },
    {
        "text": "Next, we have... hah, the Military Commission's spies all stuffed into Wasserland's Spires. They are itching to pit the goats and cats against one another as soon as they can, all so that they avert their eyes from Kazdel.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fremont"
    },
    {
        "text": "Keep your threads tidy, damn you! Remember, we too will be scurrying out of here forthwith. That boastful sheep is unlikely to tolerate us lurking about underneath her nose any longer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fremont"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've already grumbled to Laqeramaline about how that pair of siblings is far too radical. They'll have all sorts of trouble breathing down <i>our</i> necks soon, mark my words!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fremont"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'd best make haste on your work in Kazdel, Ermengarde.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fremont"
    },
    {
        "text": "If Theresis's plan does not completely succeed, the armies of Victoria... no, Leithanien and the other nations of The Core will immediately march on Kazdel.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fremont"
    },
    {
        "text": "We must inherit the legacy of Babel, and protect that city. We must not let what happened two hundred years ago repeat itself once more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fremont"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1114_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Wait.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fremont"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did that thread just move? Was that you, Ermengarde?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fremont"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1114_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fremont"
    },
    {
        "text": "I see.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fremont"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1114_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Hope'. I truly dislike having to hear that word. But it does seem like a path forward has opened for us...",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Fremont"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1114_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Isn't that right, Your Highness?",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Fremont"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Theresa sees the tiniest of smiles break through the elderly Lich's solemn visage."
    },
    {
        "text": "She loosens the transparent thread running through the depths of the void, giving her old friend a nod as he paused his complaints for a moment, before setting off for even more distant lands."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
