    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_969_1#1$3",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arges"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_969_1#8$3",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "That shadow has changed. This, I see.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arges"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_968_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yet another ill omen of yours?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eikthyrnir"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_969_1#8$3",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not completely.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arges"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_968_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "For seeking me out to inform me of what you have foreseen, you have my thanks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eikthyrnir"
    },
    {
        "text": "But my mind is unchanged. The taint that the demons bring with them is spreading, and if all we do is move south over and over again, Sami is doomed to be drowned in that filth.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eikthyrnir"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_969_1#1$3",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if everything I see pertaining to your future... ends in tragedy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arges"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_968_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I always knew it will.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eikthyrnir"
    },
    {
        "text": "As early as the time I became a Snowpriest... No, ever since I was born on this icefield, ever since I became a Sami warrior, I knew what my end would be.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eikthyrnir"
    },
    {
        "text": "I do not fear death. I also do not fear the demons stealing my body, turning me into an enemy that sows corruption with every step.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eikthyrnir"
    },
    {
        "text": "There will be younger warriors following in my footsteps, heading for the furthest reaches of the north.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eikthyrnir"
    },
    {
        "text": "If, by some misfortune, we were to meet, they will use their bows and staves to cleanse my body of its stains.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eikthyrnir"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_968_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The will to protect Sami will not so easily die out. It is thanks to this that I do not consider this outcome a tragedy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eikthyrnir"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_969_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "If that is the case, then... good fortune to you, expeditioner.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arges"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_968_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please, take this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eikthyrnir"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_969_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "A Foldartal?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arges"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_968_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "A parting gift.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eikthyrnir"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have heard that most of the Cyclops clans have decided to leave Sami. But you have chosen to stay behind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eikthyrnir"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_969_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "There was a prophecy about the survival of this land. I must make it manifest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arges"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_968_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sami will thank you for your many years of toil, Sarkaz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eikthyrnir"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have shared your foresight with me, so I in turn will grant you a sound I have heard.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eikthyrnir"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_969_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mhm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arges"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "A horn resounds across the icefield."
    },
    {
        "text": "It is a signal from the expedition, and also a way to greet others across great distances."
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps this Cyclops will not return to Kazdel, for this frozen land is already her home."
    },
    {
        "text": "Theresa's gaze overlaps with Arges's."
    },
    {
        "text": "She looks at the wondrous pattern inscribed upon the wood given to her by the Snowpriest."
    },
    {
        "text": "'Aexlun'."
    },
    {
        "text": "Flora and fauna, flourish and fall..."
    },
    {
        "text": "Last ye everlong."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
