    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_891_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Found it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "text": "These readings... It's definitely near.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_footstep_stonestep",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "channel": "step1",
        "loop": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "step1",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_537_1#2$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_891_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Watch your step. My calculations can't be wrong. We're standing on the greatest archaeological discovery in Columbia... No, in all the nations.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_537_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "So how should we go about digging a hole as fast as possible? I'd like to send myself down there alongside some energy cables.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kristen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_891_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maryam won't be happy. He would definitely prefer we explore and excavate with more care.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_891_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "But who asked him to go north and never return? The Engineering Section's in charge of this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "text": "My crew already began work before I notified you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_537_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Very good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kristen"
    },
    {
        "text": "Would you mind if I'm the first one down?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kristen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_891_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_originiumcastshort",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(In Sarkaz) 'Guard'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_537_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh? You rarely ever use incantations during your work.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kristen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_891_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have to make sure that people around me don't go fainting at the sight of some Sarkaz parlor tricks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "text": "I should probably give you the whole safety procedure spiel, Control, but I doubt you're in any mind to listen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "text": "The military and the Maylanders will be here soon. Whatever you're hoping to find, you need to make it quick.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_537_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kristen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_537_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Before my eyes are blinded by the shroud of death... I must see all that I wish to see.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kristen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
