        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Theresa sees."
    },
    {
        "text": "Time moves forward once more, by a stitch. She can feel this place reject her."
    },
    {
        "text": "She thinks back many years ago, to the first time she drew near to the heart of the Rhodes Island landship alongside Kal'tsit."
    },
    {
        "text": "This place is similar. A place she has never set foot upon. A... 'divine' residence."
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_energybody",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Unknown language) That cute little being has just left, but then in comes another intruder.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Preserver'"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Unknown language) Oh? Perhaps not?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Preserver'"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Unknown language) Within those ripples of data tagging along behind you, I sense something familiar to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Preserver'"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Unknown language) Perhaps you are like me, someone left behind in the past, a spirit with no choice but to struggle through an age not of your own.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Preserver'"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Unknown language) What has kept you going on your long sojourn? Perhaps a feeble, dim hope like mine?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Preserver'"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Unknown language) Or perhaps the cherished memories of kin you cannot see any longer?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Preserver'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
