    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take care around my lance, Dr. Kaltsit. It may tear your paper skin.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "There is nothing below the surface of the sea worthy of your attention at this point in time. What is it that you have fixed your gaze upon?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "A few memories, that's all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "I once believed that \u00c6gir was far removed from the land, that the problems it faced were of a different kind to ours.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "But perhaps I might not have been completely correct.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am surprised to see you question yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I merely do not wish to arrive late a second time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "If the ocean's troubles are not so independent of the land's, then the threats that we face may intersect with one another. This would be a situation worse than our prior worst-case scenarios.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Luckily, we have the opportunity to seize the initiative before the crisis detonates.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#3",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope that you can keep that level of confidence when you accompany me on my return to \u00c6gir.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The ones I trust are the Hunters, Gladiia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#4",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...A most amusing pretense.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Abyssal Hunters had emerged from the seafloor onto dry land, and now they prepare to return. I have seen you all change along your journey.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#4",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Change... Hehe, not quite what I expected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You will find yourselves back at your starting point.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter if it is you, Skadi or Specter, or your colleague who chose to walk along his own path of life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Ulpianus.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Best make yourselves ready.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "When the time comes, you will find yourselves with different perspectives on \u00c6gir, on the sea and the land, and on the calamities that we must face together.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "That is far more valuable than any physical bridge between our peoples.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Motes of light float above the water's surface, casting clear shadows beneath them."
    },
    {
        "text": "Just like the bridge that Kal'tsit spoke of."
    },
    {
        "text": "Theresa steps atop this bridge spanning the void. Time speeds up, the waves matching its speed, and she finds it difficult to control how her consciousness advances."
    },
    {
        "text": "Kal'tsit. Kal'tsit..."
    },
    {
        "text": "Theresa tries her best to turn her head back, to look upon her friend, and her friend's friends, new and old, standing behind her."
    },
    {
        "text": "Until they merge together with the motes of light."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
