    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "26_g2_laterano_cathedralhall",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "The motes expand."
    },
    {
        "text": "The former King of Sarkaz finds herself standing in the middle of a church, bathing in the purest light. A holy light."
    },
    {
        "text": "She stands 'face-to-face' with the Sankta Pope, his bright halo ringing his head."
    },
    {
        "text": "The young Messenger met by chance by the riverside, the gentle old man in front of the church windows... She remembers him, and time has not changed her judgement."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_358_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_356_1#8$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_356_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "It has been quite a while since any new names have emerged.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_358_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that a good thing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Apostolic Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've had many new 'saints' within a few short years. With some of their number, I have found myself hard-pressed to agree on their appointment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Apostolic Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_356_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "We still do not know what roles these saints will play in the future.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_358_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Since there have been no further saints chosen, Your Holiness, does this mean that the crisis might have already passed?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Apostolic Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_356_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You are very optimistic.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope that our Laterano can stay as optimistic as you for a very long time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI"
    },
    {
        "text": "However...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_356_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI"
    },
    {
        "text": "It has never fallen silent in the past.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_358_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Agh\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Apostolic Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your Holiness, for a moment, I wasn't able to feel...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Apostolic Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "No! How could this be?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Apostolic Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The light dies out."
    },
    {
        "text": "First, a lantern. Then, an entire city block."
    },
    {
        "text": "From the Tower of Revelations to the Notarial Hall in Pagus Michaelion, then on to the Sunset Chapel in Pagus Saint Marcel, then the chapel square..."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
