        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "It all plunges into darkness."
    },
    {
        "text": "It is swift. It is chaotic. It cannot be held back."
    },
    {
        "text": "The icefield, the ocean, the land."
    },
    {
        "text": "All the signs foretell the suffering that the people of tomorrow will face, just like the suffering she has seen many a time within Civilight Eterna."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
