        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "She emerges from the darkness. Soft golden sands shift beneath her feet."
    },
    {
        "text": "Ruins, crystal clusters, sand dunes... Everything before her eyes looks strange and unfamiliar."
    },
    {
        "text": "Raising her head above the sandy squall, she hears, sees, feels the presence of that lonely girl."
    },
    {
        "text": "The one walking right towards her, her figure wrapped in a cloak. The girl raises her hood."
    },
    {
        "text": "Originium blooms under the girl's feet like marks in the snow. Theresa sees her rhomboid pupils."
    },
    {
        "text": "You are..."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "curtain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_black",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "The sands sweep across her view, covering her eyes."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "wind",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
