        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This is not the end, but this is the furthest that Theresa can go."
    },
    {
        "text": "The darkness presses in on her, barring her way forward. It covers her eyes, smothers her thoughts."
    },
    {
        "text": "Only her passionate emotions remain, still echoing through the eternal darkness."
    },
    {
        "text": "She once held countless questions as she walked upon her journey, but once she reached her end, all that she desired was a simple answer."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
